nerships. The fund seeks to invest in below investment grade securities. It also invests through derivatives. The fund benchmarks the performance of its portfolio against the Credit Suisse Leveraged Loan Index. It was formerly known as Highland Funds I - Highland Income Fund. Highland Funds I - Highland Opportunities and Income Fund was formed on January 13, 2000 and is domiciled in the United States."}}